{
 "about": "Which chosen games overlap, and what a panel shows until its owner decides. One file, two readers: cloud/internal/schedule (the answer that counts) and site/assets/overlap.js (so the picker can show conflicts as boxes are ticked). A game occupies its start to 2 h 40 min after it (the owner's figure: regulation length); touching is not overlapping. A sequence is a maximal chain of games joined by overlaps. defaultKept is what is shown until the owner resolves a conflict: the panel's own games beat a template's, templates rank in the owner's order, then earlier start, then lower id, taken greedily. `source` is \"panel\" or a template id; `order` is the template ids in priority order.",
